  "system": {
    "identifier": "kuru-black-art-false-release",
    "description": "<p>You focus on manifesting your Yin Release in the exact way another nature release would manifest, conjuring a surge of black chakra that behaves like your chosen release to emulate. Select one of nature release, and then a point you can see within range, as a wave of black chakra erupts with the properties of the chosen release, forcing all creatures in range to make a Dexterity saving throw.</p>\n<p>Success: Affected creatures take half of 3d6 Necrotic damage</p>\n<p>Failure: Affected creatures takes 3d6 Necrotic damage, and gains 1 rank of the chosen releases condition.</p>\n<p>Earth Release: Shaken</p>\n<p>Wind Release: Bleed</p>\n<p>Fire Release: Burned</p>\n<p>Water Release: Chilled</p>\n<p>Lightning Release: Shocked.</p>\n<p>Critical Failure: Same as failure, but they take 5d6 Necrotic damage.</p>\n<p>At Higher Ranks: For each rank you cast this jutsu above D-Rank, increase the cost of this jutsu by 3 and the damage by 1d6. If this jutsu is cast at B-Rank or higher, increase the ranks of the chosen releases condition by +1. If this jutsu is cast at S-Rank, increase the ranks of the chosen releases condition by +1.</p>",
